BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Action! Action!
DTSTART:20250619T021500Z
DTEND:20250619T042000Z
DTSTAMP:20250619T021500Z
UID:U9fJHA92G4
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 103 mins (1h43m)\n\nPresented by Black Raven Films 
 Action! Action! A team of friends\, hired to steal Al Capone’s painting 
 from the Mob Museum in Las Vegas\, are double crossed. The team hunts for 
 clues\, desperately trying to find out who is behind the treachery before 
 time runs out.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/action-action
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Love
DTSTART:20250619T021500Z
DTEND:20250619T043500Z
DTSTAMP:20250619T021500Z
UID:Z0dE1MfUGV
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 119 mins (1h59m)\n\nIn defiance of societal norms\, 
 a pragmatic doctor and a compassionate nurse seek intimacy beyond the boun
 ds of conventional relationships. Part of director Dag Johan Haugerud's Se
 x-Love-Dreams trilogy.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/love
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
